ne\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  current.handler.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(method, handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Trie 路由的匹配优先级遵循：静态节点 &gt; 参数节点 &gt; 通配符节点。这意味着 <code>/users/admin</code> 会优先匹配静态路由 <code>/users/admin</code>，而非参数路由 <code>/users/:id</code>。这种优先级规则直观且可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数化路由与路径提取\">参数化路由与路径提取</h2><p>参数化路由允许 URL 中包含动态段，这些段在匹配时被提取为键值对，供处理函数使用。不同框架支持不同复杂度的参数模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/users/:id&#39;, (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const id = c.req.param(&#39;id&#39;);&#10;  return c.json({ userId: id });&#10;});&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/files/:path{.+}&#39;, (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const filePath = c.req.param(&#39;path&#39;);&#10;  return c.json({ path: filePath });&#10;});&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/posts/:year/:month/:slug&#39;, (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const { year, month, slug } = c.req.param();&#10;  return c.json({ year, month, slug });&#10;});&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/docs/*&#39;, (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const wildcard = c.req.path.replace(&#39;/docs/&#39;, &#39;&#39;);&#10;  return c.json({ path: wildcard });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"colo